ty&rsquo;s 6 grids in Wilson County shows September to October came in under 90% of normal in 39 of the 75 years since 1951. In 2025 that pair landed at 48% of normal on the middle, and August to September was at 52%. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 46% of normal on the middle. Every grid had its driest year in 2007, with grid 19108 down at 64%.</p>"}
